<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 458.8 mln rand S.African bonds Tue.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 458.8 mln rand S.African bonds Tue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 458.79  million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 47.61 million rand's worth on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
